WHAT TO USE WHERE (reels)
-------------------------
  Voice callouts (01–14) ... reaction beats: "Correct!", "Wrong!", "Game Over", "You Win"
  UI clicks/pops (15–27) .... text pop-ups, captions appearing, button taps, swooshes
  Hits (28–37) ............... punchlines, face-palm moments, comedy slaps, "pan clang"
  Digital (38–45) ............ reveals, level-ups, glitch transitions, risers
  Money (46–49) .............. earnings, views, "kaching" moments
  Mouse click (50) ........... screen recordings and tutorials

TIP: keep pops at about 40–60% volume under your voice.

